At 00:01.000, Camera tilts down and pans left to show Amy's right hand pulling the front left corner of the rug aside.

At 00:02.000, Close‑up of rug pulled aside revealing a pistol and katana hidden beneath it; Amy's right hand reaches toward the pistol.

At 00:03.000, Amy pulls the pistol out of its hidden spot, holding it upright in her right hand.

At 00:04.000, Amy swings the pistol into ready position at chest level, holding it firmly.

At 00:05.000, Amy reaches with her left hand to pick up the katana from beneath the rug.

At 00:06.000, Amy grips the katana and swings it into ready position at her left side.

At 00:07.000, Amy steps forward through the broken kitchen door into the kitchen interior, holding both weapons in ready positions.

